      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Component Types Legend:\n[Card Component] - Information display cards with rounded corners\n[List Component] - Scrollable lists with items and status indicators\n[Modal Component] - Overlay popups with close functionality\n[Chart Component] - Data visualization components (pie, bar, line charts)\n[Button Component] - Interactive buttons with hover states\n[Dropdown Component] - Select dropdowns with arrow indicators\n[Status Badge Component] - Color-coded status indicators with icons\n[Tooltip Component] - Hover information displays\n[Loading Component] - Spinner and loading state indicators",
      "baseline": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Component Types Legend:\n[Card Component] - Information display cards with rounded corners\n[List Component] - Scrollable lists with items and status indicators\n[Modal Component] - Overlay popups with close functionality\n[Chart Component] - Data visualization components (pie, bar, line charts)\n[Button Component] - Interactive buttons with hover states\n[Dropdown Component] - Select dropdowns with arrow indicators\n[Status Badge Component] - Color-coded status indicators with icons\n[Tooltip Component] - Hover information displays\n[Loading Component] - Spinner and loading state indicators",
